# Defence in depth (added 2026-08-10, security audit). The rules above are
# path-specific; these catch the same kinds of file if one is ever written
# somewhere new. The *.example.yaml templates stay tracked on purpose.
.env
.env.*
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
**/token*.json
**/*credential*.json
**/*client_secret*.json
*.pem
*.p12

# untracked scratch working files (only *.json / *.md were covered before)
scratch_priors/_*

# PRIVACY RED LINE (recite / 念稿练习, 2026-08-29). Her voice recordings, the ASR
# transcripts of them, the reference TTS, the copied original interview audio, and every
# graded take must never enter git history. Broad on purpose: anything under data/recite/
# is personal audio or a judgement about how she speaks.
data/recite/
data/recite_numbers.yaml
data/recite_lessons.md
data/seeds/openers.json
rough_queue.md
data/recite/**

